# Trivy exceptions for the release image scan (.github/workflows/release-image.yml reads this file).
# None at the moment. The two Spring Framework 6.2 exceptions of v0.6.0 (CVE-2026-47884, CVE-2026-47890) were
# removed with the move to Spring Boot 4.1 (Spring Framework 7.0.10, ADR-020).
# An exception needs its reason here and an expiry on the same line as the ID: Trivy ignores a comment
# line, so a "# exp:" comment would leave the exception permanent. Example: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
